    narr:narration """Verification controls and operational gates addressing unsigned artifacts center on establishing a mandatory [signed release manifest requirement](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for Meridian deployments. This operational gate extends its [scope to staging and production](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) environments, enforced directly in response to [past security incidents involving unsigned artifacts](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2). The initiative is established as a firm [decision-level policy](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) with designated [ownership assigned to Quinton Fairweather](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
